      "en": "The earth is utterly broken. The earth is torn apart. The earth is shaken violently.",
      "ko": "땅이 깨어지고 깨어지며 땅이 갈라지고 땅이 흔들리고 흔들리며",
      "source_text_hash": "4fdbdc167e318046efce157c24b821d7b0b3c48965686adf0922a8760d3ff70d",
      "translation_text_hash": "8cbd9c099e1e159722c12e25a3df849c6d123c69b5cb9d629e9eafd38e05ca03",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "땅이 깨어지고 깨어지며 땅이 갈라지고 땅이 흔들리고 흔들리며"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "8cbd9c099e1e159722c12e25a3df849c6d123c69b5cb9d629e9eafd38e05ca03"
