      "en": "They will be gathered together, as prisoners are gathered in the pit, and will be shut up in the prison; and after many days they will be visited.",
      "ko": "그들이 죄수가 깊은 옥에 모임 같이 모음을 입고 옥에 갇혔다가 여러 날 후에 형벌을 받을 것이라",
      "source_text_hash": "6129ad59c356ccbdd239e00ac29cc9a425f3e8a9fe3b504b71e4bcf9f471f924",
      "translation_text_hash": "1e423f8614b71c97835016e7f1c3ad5fb3b1a75720783fa48f048006a0511a57",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
